receipts.text:
{
  "paper": "GOD AS ROOT - Long Edition",
  "core_relation": {
    "sentence": "The entire framework depends on a single axiom — the Trinitarian God as self-grounding ground — from which existence, distinction, relation, and orientation are derived, and through which physics becomes the created medium where love, choice, consequence, time, repair, and grace can be publicly real.",
    "quote": "One axiom. Four debts paid. Everything else derives from this through formal grammar constrained by physics. [S037-S039]"
  },
  "product_test": {
    "answer": "multiplicative",
    "quote": "If God COULD be proven, God would not be the ground. [S045]",
    "reason": "The paper explicitly treats the root axiom as non-optional: if the Trinitarian ground is removed or zeroed, the four debts (existence, distinction, relation, orientation) are unpaid and the entire derivation grammar collapses. The logic is conjunctive, not additive — every downstream claim depends on the axiom holding."
  },
  "slots": [
    {
      "slot": "G",
      "plays_role": "The external negentropy influx is God as the necessary, self-grounding source that sustains a universe which would otherwise run down; grace enters from beyond the closed system.",
      "quote": "If closed systems collapse and the universe has not collapsed, then something external sustains it. [S290]",
      "fit": "direct"
    },
    {
      "slot": "M",
      "plays_role": "Alignment is love as the ground-state coupling between the Trinitarian persons and the orientation of creation toward God; the system is aligned when it is rightly related to its source.",
      "quote": "Love: the ground state of the coupling between them. [S022]",
      "fit": "direct"
    },
    {
      "slot": "E",
      "plays_role": "Signal fidelity is truth, the Word, and information that survives transmission — light never degrades in transit, and revelation is the signal God transmits to creatures.",
      "quote": "Never degrades in transit -- a photon from 13 billion years ago arrives with its original information intact. [S159]",
      "fit": "direct"
    },
    {
      "slot": "S_eff",
      "plays_role": "Effective entropy is the Second Law and the decay of closed systems; it is what lowers coherence and makes grace necessary.",
      "quote": "The Second Law: entropy always increases in a closed system. You cannot cheat it. [S164-S165]",
      "fit": "direct"
    },
    {
      "slot": "T",
      "plays_role": "Temporal integration is time as the medium of covenant, sequence, patience, hope, and the progressive revelation that builds a reference frame over history.",
      "quote": "Time is not a prison. It is the medium of covenant. [S095-S096]",
      "fit": "direct"
    },
    {
      "slot": "K",
      "plays_role": "Compression is the Logos — the ordered language and formal grammar through which the infinite God is compressed into intelligible law, story, and equation.",
      "quote": "Physics is the grammar of that world. It is not the Author. It is the ordered language the Author speaks... [S069-S071]",
      "fit": "analogous"
    },
    {
      "slot": "R",
      "plays_role": "Phase transition is the cross and resurrection: a threshold event where entropy is locally reversed and the system changes state rather than degree.",
      "quote": "Second: entropy -- the rule that everything falls apart when left alone -- gets locally reversed by connecting the system to a source outside itself. [S223]",
      "fit": "direct"
    },
    {
      "slot": "Q",
      "plays_role": "Superposition is open possibility and genuine agency — the unresolved capacity to choose, refuse, or receive, which must be actualized by free will.",
      "quote": "Agency allows refusal. [S186]",
      "fit": "analogous"
    },
    {
      "slot": "F",
      "plays_role": "Non-local correlation is perichoresis and the entanglement-like mutual indwelling of the Trinitarian persons, and by extension the constitutive relation between God and creation.",
      "quote": "Relation is perichoresis -- the persons indwell each other constitutively. [S035]",
      "fit": "direct"
    },
    {
      "slot": "C",
      "plays_role": "Integration is the local integrator: the Trinitarian structure itself as the single axiom that integrates existence, distinction, relation, and orientation into one coherent ground.",
      "quote": "The Trinity pays all four from one structure. [S032]",
      "fit": "direct"
    }
  ],
  "breaks": [
    "The paper treats 'agency' as a required extra factor with no dedicated slot in the master equation; it is the repeated missing piece in all ten law mappings, but the canonical slot list has no A for agency.",
    "The paper's product test is stated for the root axiom, not for the full χ product; several downstream factors (e.g., physics as medium) are described as necessary conditions rather than multiplicative contributors.",
    "The slot K (compression) is only analogically present: the paper speaks of grammar, language, and Logos, but does not frame this as compression or compressibility in the Shannon sense.",
    "The slot Q (superposition) is stretched: the paper's 'open possibility' is theological agency, not quantum superposition, and the paper does not use quantum formalism to ground it.",
    "The paper adds 'narrative' and 'progressive revelation' as a temporal pedagogy that has no direct slot; it functions as a meta-factor shaping how T is received rather than as a separate multiplicative term."
  ],
  "extra_factors": [
    "Agency — the capacity to receive or refuse, named as the repeated structural gap in all ten law mappings (S246-S250).",
    "Narrative / progressive revelation — God building a reference frame over time so receivers can parse the signal (S343-S354).",
    "Cross-Resolution Method — a meta-method for testing claims across theology, physics, mathematics, lived reality, and bridge registers (S276-S288)."
  ],
  "analog_strength": 4,
  "confidence": "medium",
  "one_line": "The paper's single Trinitarian axiom functions as a multiplicative root for a χ-like product in which God supplies G, M, E, S_eff, T, R, F, and C, while agency and narrative appear as extra factors the canonical slots do not name.",
  "equations_present": false
}
